.tox/
.pytest_cache/
test_deployment_env.html

# Docker
backend/coverage.lcov
test.db
backend/python-packages/

# Prevent Copilot/AI-generated documentation spam
# Generated docs should go through review process
**/COPILOT_*.md
**/copilot-*.md
**/*-copilot-*.md
**/*_SUMMARY.md
!docs/DOCUMENTATION_CLEANUP_SUMMARY.md
**/*_COMPLETE.md
**/*_COMPLETION.md
**/*_FIX_*.md
docs/archive/
docs/temp/
docs/scratch/
test_pr_workflow_update_ui.md
failure.log

# Claude Code agent worktrees (scratch clones, never part of the repo)
.claude/worktrees/
